    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 <strong>&quot;Rana Card&quot;</strong> is a roguelite card game \ud83d\udc38<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll play as a farm manager, completing KPI set by the Frog Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards in exciting, tense moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate or exploit <strong>time explosions</strong>\ud83d\udca5!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn card packs and treasure chests,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards to earn money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose your path,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And face a variety of decision-making events, disaster years, and cataclysms along the way. <br> <br><strong>============================================================================= </strong> <br>  <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Exciting Card Draws</strong> \ud83c\udf3e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1755164462\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have a magical bag filled with unique cards, each with its <strong>time value</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you\u2019ll need to draw as many cards as possible within the <strong>time limit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude2e Want to draw one more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude0f How about one more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude2b Maybe another one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice could be a stroke of genius... or the start of a nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware, exceeding the time limit will trigger a <strong>time explosion</strong>\ud83d\udca5!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time explosions aren\u2019t always bad, though\u2014if you get the right cards, you can exploit or avoid them!\ud83d\udc4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>============================================================================= </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Infinite Strategy with Deck Combos</strong> \ud83c\udf31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1755164462\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we\u2019ve designed:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ unique cards: spells, plants, animals, buildings, and derivatives;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ powerful pendants: combo with various decks or enhance your gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With at least dozens of different playstyles to explore, each experience feels unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>============================================================================= </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Face Challenging Disaster Years</strong> \ud83c\udf0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/baed8a5e021238abf48a75c7d6a5843e.avif?t=1755164462\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is the key as you progress through the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ decision-rich map events;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ tough but rewarding disaster years;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ types of cataclysms with special mechanics; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>============================================================================= </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf40 <strong>Surprising and Diverse Rewards</strong> \ud83c\udf40</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1755164462\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll be able to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open card packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open supply chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Frog Scratchers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, cards, pendants, and more\u2014various ways to get rewards will provide rich experiences and progression in the game!</p></li></ul>",
