ss=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ tough but rewarding disaster years;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ types of cataclysms with special mechanics; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>============================================================================= </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf40 <strong>Surprising and Diverse Rewards</strong> \ud83c\udf40</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong> </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1755164462\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll be able to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open card packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open supply chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Frog Scratchers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, cards, pendants, and more\u2014various ways to get rewards will provide rich experiences and progression in the game!</p></li></ul>",
